  "text": "## i. Reset trip (page 44)\n[E1] Center press the joystick with the reset trip option selected to reset the trip.\n[E2] There are two options available: Reset trip 1 and reset trip 2.\n[E3] 0\n[E4] 0\n[E5] The options can be navigated by joystick up and down press and selected by joystick center press.\n[E6] Selecting either reset trip 1 or reset trip 2 will show a confirmation popup for reset.\n[E7] Press the home button on the LH switch cube to go back.\n\n## IF PRESS JOYSTICK LEFT (pages 36-37)\n[E8] The following details are displayed on the advanced dashboard.\n[E9] Trip 1\n[E10] Trip 2\n[E11] Fuel range\n[E12] Instantaneous fuel consumption\n[E13] Battery gauge\n[E14] Service Due In\n[E15] Engine temperature\n[E16] The above details can be customized in my vehicle option available in the settings menu."
